msgid ""
"Your PC restarts in Windows and opens it. If %1 there asks to install it, choose its option to locate the game instead and pick %2: it's there already."
msgstr ""
"Je pc herstart in Windows en opent hem. Vraagt %1 daar om hem te installeren, kies dan in plaats daarvan de optie om de game te zoeken en kies %2: hij staat er al."

